  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    R = len(grid)\n    C = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Find the four non-zero points\n    points = []\n    for r in range(R):\n        for c in range(C):\n            if grid[r][c] != 0:\n                points.append((r, c, grid[r][c]))\n                \n    if not points:\n        return [row[:] for row in grid]\n        \n    r_min = min(p[0] for p in points)\n    r_max = max(p[0] for p in points)\n    c_min = min(p[1] for p in points)\n    c_max = max(p[1] for p in points)\n    \n    # Identify corners\n    top_left = next(p[2] for p in points if p[0] == r_min and p[1] == c_min)\n    top_right = next(p[2] for p in points if p[0] == r_min and p[1] == c_max)\n    bottom_left = next(p[2] for p in points if p[0] == r_max and p[1] == c_min)\n    bottom_right = next(p[2] for p in points if p[0] == r_max and p[1] == c_max)\n    \n    out_grid = [[0] * C for _ in range(R)]\n    \n    # Draw 3x3 blocks\n    def draw_block(r, c, center_val, border_val):\n        for i in range(r - 1, r + 2):\n            for j in range(c - 1, c + 2):\n                if 0 <= i < R and 0 <= j < C:\n                    if i == r and j == c:\n                        out_grid[i][j] = center_val\n                    else:\n                        out_grid[i][j] = border_val\n\n    draw_block(r_min, c_min, top_left, top_right)\n    draw_block(r_min, c_max, top_right, top_left)\n    draw_block(r_max, c_min, bottom_left, bottom_right)\n    draw_block(r_max, c_max, bottom_right, bottom_left)\n    \n    # Draw horizontal connections\n    gap_c_start = c_min + 2\n    gap_c_end = c_max - 2\n    if gap_c_start <= gap_c_end:\n        for c in range(gap_c_start, gap_c_end + 1):\n            dist = min(c - gap_c_start, gap_c_end - c)\n            if dist % 2 == 0:\n                if 0 <= r_min < R: out_grid[r_min][c] = 5\n                if 0 <= r_max < R: out_grid[r_max][c] = 5\n\n    # Draw vertical connections\n    gap_r_start = r_min + 2\n    gap_r_end = r_max - 2\n    if gap_r_start <= gap_r_end:\n        for r in range(gap_r_start, gap_r_end + 1):\n            dist = min(r - gap_r_start, gap_r_end - r)\n            if dist % 2 == 0:\n                if 0 <= c_min < C: out_grid[r][c_min] = 5\n                if 0 <= c_max < C: out_grid[r][c_max] = 5\n                \n    return out_grid\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    R = len(grid)\n    C = len(grid[0])\n    \n    # Find the four non-zero points\n    points = []\n    for r in range(R):\n        for c in range(C):\n            if grid[r][c] != 0:\n                points.append((r, c, grid[r][c]))\n                \n    if not points:\n        return [row[:] for row in grid]\n        \n    r_min = min(p[0] for p in points)\n    r_max = max(p[0] for p in points)\n    c_min = min(p[1] for p in points)\n    c_max = max(p[1] for p in points)\n    \n    # Identify corners\n    top_left = next(p[2] for p in points if p[0] == r_min and p[1] == c_min)\n    top_right = next(p[2] for p in points if p[0] == r_min and p[1] == c_max)\n    bottom_left = next(p[2] for p in points if p[0] == r_max and p[1] == c_min)\n    bottom_right = next(p[2] for p in points if p[0] == r_max and p[1] == c_max)\n    \n    out_grid = [[0] * C for _ in range(R)]\n    \n    # Draw 3x3 blocks\n    def draw_block(r, c, center_val, border_val):\n        for i in range(r - 1, r + 2):\n            for j in range(c - 1, c + 2):\n                if 0 <= i < R and 0 <= j < C:\n                    if i == r and j == c:\n                        out_grid[i][j] = center_val\n                    else:\n                        out_grid[i][j] = border_val\n\n    draw_block(r_min, c_min, top_left, top_right)\n    draw_block(r_min, c_max, top_right, top_left)\n    draw_block(r_max, c_min, bottom_left, bottom_right)\n    draw_block(r_max, c_max, bottom_right, bottom_left)\n    \n    # Draw horizontal connections\n    gap_c_start = c_min + 2\n    gap_c_end = c_max - 2\n    if gap_c_start <= gap_c_end:\n        for c in range(gap_c_start, gap_c_end + 1):\n            dist = min(c - gap_c_start, gap_c_end - c)\n            if dist % 2 == 0:\n                if 0 <= r_min < R: out_grid[r_min][c] = 5\n                if 0 <= r_max < R: out_grid[r_max][c] = 5\n\n    # Draw vertical connections\n    gap_r_start = r_min + 2\n    gap_r_end = r_max - 2\n    if gap_r_start <= gap_r_end:\n        for r in range(gap_r_start, gap_r_end + 1):\n            dist = min(r - gap_r_start, gap_r_end - r)\n            if dist % 2 == 0:\n                if 0 <= c_min < C: out_grid[r][c_min] = 5\n                if 0 <= c_max < C: out_grid[r][c_max] = 5\n                \n    return out_grid",
